{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whiskers and Wizardry is an action-packed Bullet Hell Roguelite where you play as a spell-slinging feline with a powerful magical tome and a bad attitude. Craft devastating spells, dodge an endless barrage of deadly projectiles, and use cunning feline powers to claw your way through intense battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/13b38b13ce677f24fdfc021ab6d3edb5.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/89dc3bd591fd366fc08cce8883ac80d1.poster.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/89dc3bd591fd366fc08cce8883ac80d1.webm?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/89dc3bd591fd366fc08cce8883ac80d1.mp4?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash and dodge your way out of danger as the neverending spree of deadly bullets pushes your paws to the limit in a blaze of chaotic magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/f844ea56cabd4574a3f49756054efc6d.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/8d248afed9199a24671b8ee32eab59b5.poster.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/8d248afed9199a24671b8ee32eab59b5.webm?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/8d248afed9199a24671b8ee32eab59b5.mp4?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the supreme power of the feline magic and a unique Spell Rune system, you can create and experiment with an incomprehensible amount of different spell builds each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/620b421cbc0cb84df1c2ca5dcebbb909.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/23938ce5aeb429e6e09ab9489366261e.poster.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/23938ce5aeb429e6e09ab9489366261e.webm?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/23938ce5aeb429e6e09ab9489366261e.mp4?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a bullet hell roguelite that punishes sloppiness but rewards precision and strategic spellcrafting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good. This isn\u2019t a petting simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/45206b5998a8fbd276067b32ad74801d.avif?t=1760003071\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/96d3cd54022926d9ad3c6e8b2f910d37.poster.avif?t=1760003071\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/96d3cd54022926d9ad3c6e8b2f910d37.webm?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/extras/96d3cd54022926d9ad3c6e8b2f910d37.mp4?t=1760003071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you can upgrade your feline powers and your craft your magic tome to become more powerful. Within each run you craft your spells to suit your needs in your specific attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326820?t=1760003071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760003071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/bfa0301317f5f603e9d101476145e6b59d7087c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760003071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326820/bfa0301317f5f603e9d101476145e6b59d7087c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760003071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3470910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whiskers and Wizardry is an action-packed Bullet Hell Roguelite where you play as a spell-slinging feline with a powerful magical tome and a bad attitude.